            ^"Characteristics" STRING "Int +2, Per 0, Pre +1, Com +2, Str –1, Sta 0, Dex +1, Qik 0"
            ^"Size" STRING "0"
            ^"Age" STRING "25 (25)"
            ^"Decrepitude" STRING "0"
            ^"Warping Score" STRING "0 (0)"
            ^"Confidence Score" STRING "1 (3)"
            ^"Virtues and Flaws" STRING "The Gift; Hermetic Magus; Gentle Gift; Affinity with Imaginem, Free Expression, Minor Magical Focus (music), Performance Magic (Music), Puissant Music, Well Traveled; Plagued by Supernatural Entity (Taliesin), Twilight Prone; Delusion (Thinks himself to be part of a forgotten pre-Diedne lineage), Noncombatant House Virtue"
            ^"Personality Traits" STRING "Gregarious +2, Cheerful +1, Determined +1"
            ^"Reputations" STRING "None"
            ^"Combat" STRING "Dodge: Init +0, Attack N/A, Defense +0, Damage N/A Fist: Init +0, Attack +1, Defense +0, Damage –1 Kick: Init –1, Attack +1, Defense –1, Damage +2 Bludgeon: Init –1, Attack +3, Defense +0, Damage +1"
            ^"Soak" STRING "+0"
            ^"Fatigue Levels" STRING "OK, 0, –1, –3, –5, Unconscious"
            ^"Wound Penalties" STRING "–1 (1–5), –3 (6–10), –5 (11–15), Incapacitated (16–20), Dead (21+)"
            ^"Abilities" STRING "Artes Liberales 1 (ceremonial magic), Carouse 2 (entertaining), Charm 2 (with song), Concentration 2 (spell concentration), English 2 (poetry), Etiquette 1 (court), Finesse 2 (Imaginem), Folk Ken 2 (judging the mood of the audience), Latin 4 (Hermetic usage), Magic Theory 4 (Imaginem), Music 2+2 (sing), Norman French 2 (poetry), Parma Magica 1 (Mentem), Penetration 1 (Mentem), Philosophiae 1 (ceremonial magic), Stonehenge Lore 1 (legends), Welsh 5 (storytelling)"
            ^"Arts" STRING "Cr 10, In 2, Mu 1, Pe 2, Re 7, An 2, Aq 0, Au 0, Co 01, He 2, Ig 0, Im 4, Me 10, Te 0, Vi 1"
            ^"Twilight Scars" STRING "None"
            ^"Equipment" STRING "Crwth and bow"
            ^"Encumbrance" STRING "0 (0)"
            ^"Spells Known" STRING "The Magic Flute (CrHe 5/+12) Heal Thy Broken Voice (CrHe 20/+14) Let the Sun Not Bother Me This Day (PeIg 10/+2) Prying Eyes (InIm 5/+4) Confound the Rival Singer (MuIm 4/+6) Notes of a Delightful Sound (MuIm 10/+5) The Welcome Stranger (CrMe 15/+20) To Sing of Good Meat and Drink (CrMe 25/+30) The Call to Slumber (ReMe 10/+17) The Well-Trodden Path (ReTe 10/+7) Sense of Faerie Power (InVi 2/+1) Sense of Infernal Power (InVi 2/+1) Sense of Magical Power (InVi 2/+1) includes Magical Focus"
            ^"Vis" STRING "Yestin usually carries a handful of vis of various Techniques and Forms, to offer as gifts or payments to other magi he knows."
            ^"Appearance" STRING "Yestin has fair hair, which he wears brushed forward, and his eyes sparkle out from a plain and open face that rarely loses its broad smile. He normally wears simple clothes well suited to the life of a traveler, but his wizardly robes are bright and woven of many colors. He is never without his crwth and its bow, and carries the instrument in a fitted leather satchel."
            ^"Sigil" STRING "Yestin’s spells and device effects always enjoy a moment of calm, like an intake of breath, before releasing themselves. He votes with a simple, though highly polished, wooden flute."
            ^"Source" STRING "Magi of Hermes"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 136
        }
    }

